    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "I remember before I was born, wounded up like a fur ball in the highly overrated fetal position, luckily I'm not claustrophobic, but on rainy days I still feel a tightness in my left shoulder."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 17,
        "line": 837,
        "text": "Things haven't exactly calmed down around here, I got an A+ on the report, Dad's getting used to my pierced ears and Nick's coming to visit this summer. Other than that I'm busy being a big sister."
      }
